; editrev.eval - the edit counter live validation re-runs on (editor-updates
; P0): it must MOVE on a change and STAY PUT on a no-op, or the checker would
; either miss an edit or re-run on nothing.
;
;   r0  start
;   r1  after painting a square          (moved)
;   r2  after painting it the same again (a no-op: unchanged)
;   r3  after undo                       (moved)

logecho on
reset
editor rev
editor place floors floor_slabs 5 5
editor rev
editor place floors floor_slabs 5 5
editor rev
undo
editor rev
